[{"title":"承吴献臣明府王日雨进士张廷实地曹饯别东山寺用地曹韵留别三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"东山追饯谢诸公，海色山光兴味同。\n晚霁岂须愁急雨，更移烟艇逐溪风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51858,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题卢居士小像","author":"林光","text":"梦断华胥像此传，山林风韵尚悠然。\n丹青不写心中影，谁识斯人是葛天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51859,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石门西华寺三首 其一","author":"林光","text":"远水接长堤，疏松绕斜谷。\n入寺不逢僧，一犬吠深竹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51860,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石门西华寺三首 其二","author":"林光","text":"手把芙蓉花，笑坐西华寺。\n香风吹白莲，十年今一至。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51861,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石门西华寺三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"滚滚复滚滚，百年如一瞬。\n秋色入西华，笑嚼新烧笋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51862,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过峡山寺二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"悬崖青绝不知名，崖树株株弄晚晴。\n门掩溪流僧舍静，片帆冲破绿波轻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51863,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过峡山寺二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"白云轻罩树高低，溪绕青山山蘸溪。\n篷底卧看山两面，懒携樽酒入招提。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51864,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七月十七日将至韶州","author":"林光","text":"瘦病篙师撑急滩，雨添新潦转愁难。\n天公正布新秋令，肯把南风送冷官。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51865,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南园草屋","author":"林光","text":"偶阁蓬苑向草莱，何人指点百花开。\n春风吹送梅关雨，曾寄南川一榻来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51866,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"金陵浦润少为僧既长弃僧归依父母","author":"林光","text":"醉舞莱衣乐似仙，人间何处是西天。\n且将尺帻韬陀发，却委袈裟付老禅。\n骨肉思情离复合，宗先支派断还传。\n沙门怕有回头者，试诵吾诗一两联。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51867,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭时褒四首 其一","author":"林光","text":"愁来欲写不成诗，哭尽寒冬眼似痴。\n魂梦不交垂死后，聪灵空忆在生时。\n云山有限来何远，天地无情叫岂知。\n四尺沙棺归万里，空馀血泪写童碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51868,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭时褒四首 其二","author":"林光","text":"少年随侍白头亲，何物天灾滥杀人。\n疮累豆麻攻半月，语闻丝发话经旬。\n牛医底解生王宪，端悫何如误伯淳。\n恸倚京城挥老泪，西风黯黯起寒云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51869,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭时褒四首 其三","author":"林光","text":"老者偏存少者亡，化机颠倒断人肠。\n商南谁识昌黎苦，东鲁愁催子夏忙。\n遗语每思童孝子，捷才堪见旧诗囊。\n两行珠泪何时竭，山作江湖海植桑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51870,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"哭时褒四首 其四","author":"林光","text":"恸哭长安泪眼枯，幽冥骨肉已殊途。\n渥洼无计医龙种，丹穴愁看瘗凤雏。\n官绊远方怜我蹇，榇归万里倩谁扶。\n归囊舟买南安便，宗葬千年得遂无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51871,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王敬止行人使朝鲜次定山韵","author":"林光","text":"大明日月华夷照，命下朝鲜得献臣。\n净扫糠秕须大手，撑持天地属何人。\n居庸关拥云中骑，鸭绿江浮眼底春。\n欲尽临岐无限意，千峰含笑振衣尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51872,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"直沽阻风二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"日日南风故打头，北风何事亦维舟。\n狂风舞乱河边柳，多少行人不自由。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51873,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"直沽阻风二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"白头花鸟本无心，黄雾遮天午日阴。\n断岸孤舟聊一系，閒愁争似海潮深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51874,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉新偶述二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"扰扰复扰扰，浮尘飞不了。\n回首望京华，云边过一鸟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51875,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"奉新偶述二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"顺风不开帆，逆风牵远浪。\n平居见瞭然，临事忽然丧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51876,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽黄良贵郎中父省高压庵卷","author":"林光","text":"泷冈何处表新阡，教铎分持二十年。\n官秩貌能高死后，丹青谁解判生前。\n虫声唧唧悲朝露，冢木围围锁暮烟。\n一代光荣过一代，几人无恨抱终天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51877,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"时褒柩得便舟先发四首 其一","author":"林光","text":"飞旐嗔人眼，舟师讳莫言。\n但求归骨肉，宁复吝行缠。\n百岁终同死，他生更结缘。\n惟应谢浮世，父子见重泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51878,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"时褒柩得便舟先发四首 其二","author":"林光","text":"昼夜同生死，达人垂大观。\n彭殇均此气，天地一圆棺。\n老境成痴梦，浮生过急湍。\n此心远相送，长夜路漫漫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51879,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"时褒柩得便舟先发四首 其三","author":"林光","text":"长途归短柩，默默托诸侯。\n节照千山暮，帆开五月秋。\n鄱阳趋镜水，章贡夺滩流。\n去去休惊恐，梅关近广州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51880,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"时褒柩得便舟先发四首 其四","author":"林光","text":"回生空袖手，送死谩题诗。\n肠断南城外，舟催闸鼓时。\n乡心飞野马，身计绊残棋。\n知汝英灵在，能无念父慈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51881,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送高大用尹邵武","author":"林光","text":"谁伸赤手拯颠连，黄甲频年令选贤。\n世味总成催白发，莺花聊尔共青天。\n南闽宰绩君须显，东鲁儒言我未便。\n景仰平生朱宪副，好将民瘼问从前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51882,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与杨居敬大尹叙别","author":"林光","text":"漕河谁遣此舟连，旅次相看岂乏贤。\n闸水正添催麦雨，酒杯频送熟梅天。\n除书分领千山远，侍御携行一水便。\n说别偶来经汶上，沧浪歌动晚风前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51883,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登太白楼 其一","author":"林光","text":"何处登高望眼明，天风催送上任城。\n千年未听知心话，二老空馀后世名。\n汶泗远交襟带水，丹青难会古今情。\n除书愧捧仍东鲁，野服逢人更问程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51884,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登太白楼 其二","author":"林光","text":"面面虚窗借日明，层楼高压济宁城。\n偶来此地扪碑迹，却喜无人识姓名。\n麟凤他时空在野，江山千古未忘情。\n乡关南望来时路，何日归舟促去程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51885,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登太白楼 其三","author":"林光","text":"野麦青青野日明，漕河一线绕孤城。\n乾坤磊落思贤哲，人世分拿总利名。\n触目烟云皆是画，无心花鸟更多情。\n登高一望一回首，及圣宫墙路几程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51886,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登太白楼 其四","author":"林光","text":"凤凰台上望分明，白鹭洲连白下城。\n好景未忘崔灏句，此楼谁扁谪仙名。\n一樽留醉任人里，千载来歌越客情。\n纵步危栏虽百尺，天阶犹有未趋程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51887,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兖州到任","author":"林光","text":"阴晴天意未分明，策马胡为又鲁城。\n礼乐虽能扶圣教，文章吾甚愧虚名。\n深杯未易消魔障，老眼还能识世情。\n白饭羹鱼南海上，梦中何日定归程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51888,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒孔庙二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"教铎何缘又兖东，圣乡今古共推崇。\n仰钻瞻忽千年下，富贵功名一瞬中。\n泰岳试登天下小，秋阳初拜万方红。\n宫墙数仞堂堂在，头白谁收入室功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51889,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒孔庙二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"步趋洙泗认西东，圣道天阶本自崇。\n丽日常悬霄汉上，浮生空老梦魂中。\n林瞻孔木千年秀，炉炷心香一瓣红。\n再拜拟酬平素愿，此生陶铸是谁功。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51890,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲阜道中二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"到处苑檐借隙光，共瞻晴日上扶桑。\n缓沿泗水寻真脉，老愧斯文在圣乡。\n心醉阳和疑卯酒，梦回花鸟忽宫墙。\n庸知人事非天意，百尺竿头道路长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51891,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲阜道中二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"暮林无意趁风光，戴胜飞鸣只在桑。\n薄宦我何堪远郡，白头亲老在穷乡。\n陈情北级那无表，失学今吾愧面墙。\n百拜孔林还百祷，心香飞绕白云长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51892,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒孔子墓","author":"林光","text":"晨烟初散百花明，端木墙边感慨生。\n山拥翠屏俱有意，云蟠封树不知名。\n乾坤更拜何人墓，翁仲真含万古情。\n势入浮云今几见，百王争似素王陵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51893,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孔子手植桧","author":"林光","text":"棱棱老干傍庭台，传自宣尼手自栽。\n翡翠枝条深雨露，蛰龙鳞甲照阶苔。\n枯荣自寓随时意，古怪中含造化胎。\n三匝绕栏殊未厌，却疑天遣此身来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51894,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登兖州城西楼","author":"林光","text":"城头过片雨，风急袖披披。\n山势开邹鲁，河流会泗沂。\n行云摩塔顶，远树没天涯。\n怀古思乡意，交加点入诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51895,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岳云楼","author":"林光","text":"景色为谁好，新愁入我深。\n白云空望断，老病更侵寻。\n睥睨开青嶂，郊原锁暮阴。\n行藏今古异，同地不同心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51896,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东鲁门 其一","author":"林光","text":"贪拜贫官不疗贫，脚根还踏鲁东门。\n题诗试问门前客，鲁叟何缘也在陈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51897,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东鲁门 其二","author":"林光","text":"东鲁东周迹已陈，古人风致又今人。\n绕城桑柘苍烟外，依旧青山问白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51898,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东鲁门 其三","author":"林光","text":"曲曲河流远远山，参差台殿百花间。\n天机满眼谁收拾，太极圈中着语难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51899,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东鲁门 其四","author":"林光","text":"沂泗交流一派斜，轻烟笼罩万人家。\n灵光古殿无寻处，惟见黄槐几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51900,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"颜乐亭三首 其一","author":"林光","text":"千秋颜乐许谁寻，亭址依然废井阴。\n看尽浮云无一片，只留明月在中心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51901,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"颜乐亭三首 其二","author":"林光","text":"真乐人间何处寻，闲驱我马过松阴。\n那知欲识颜回面，不在斯亭祇在心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51902,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"颜乐亭三首 其三","author":"林光","text":"陋巷之中操一瓢，人间贫贱不相饶。\n如何千古如愚意，纵有丹青不解描。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51903,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尼山","author":"林光","text":"泰岳东南一脉分，五峰罗列一峰尊。\n谁知元气当交会，也用精诚感厚坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51904,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"承少参孙拙庵佥宪王耻斋二明公枉驾茶园","author":"林光","text":"道夷荆棘剪篷蒿，父老欢呼导羽旄。\n十里风光瞻使节，一川云水醉人豪。\n裒衣博带寿閒运，野鼠天狐迹已逃。\n看尽青山一回首，几人挥破簿书劳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51905,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王佥宪同孙少参枉驾敝庐留诗见赠奉答兼呈张少参先生四首 其一","author":"林光","text":"几点秋山落照边，白头相对共茫然。\n尘氛且莫催人别，清话真穷太古先。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51906,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王佥宪同孙少参枉驾敝庐留诗见赠奉答兼呈张少参先生四首 其二","author":"林光","text":"浮生南北本无期，老眼相看更几时。\n回首金牛空堕泪，先生高处许谁知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51907,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王佥宪同孙少参枉驾敝庐留诗见赠奉答兼呈张少参先生四首 其三","author":"林光","text":"逢人何处话先天，梦落烟霞二十年。\n相见相期应未浅，木根终透石盘坚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51908,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王佥宪同孙少参枉驾敝庐留诗见赠奉答兼呈张少参先生四首 其四","author":"林光","text":"随花傍柳出孤城，望拜肩舆我亦应。\n莫道穷乡供奉少，晚山秋霁景天成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51909,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和罗一峰赠王乐用侍御二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"金牛他日意，问讯欲潸如。\n至乐无穷味，谁知不在书。\n秋波双眼碧，夜月老怀虚。\n何日车溪路，能来问起居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51910,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和罗一峰赠王乐用侍御二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"年衰还仗禄，头白更忧时。\n御史平生志，金牛绝代期。\n放身归自在，与世共推移。\n霄汉长松树，天风一任吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51911,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵孙少参见寄二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"小队戎行列晚晴，穷乡犹自说人英。\n如何剡曲飘然兴，千载能留雪夜名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51912,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵孙少参见寄二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"斯文久矣厌虚名，忽枉高轩是宠荣。\n何物敢留公一醉，白云香袅篆烟清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51913,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"铜仁太守挽","author":"林光","text":"青青离离木拱时，谁镌太守墓前碑。\n铜仁德泽知深浅，却有贤孙索挽诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51914,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孙少参父母挽","author":"林光","text":"阅月初更甲乙年，双亲相继入重泉。\n慈乌梦里音容隔，杜宇声中血泪连。\n直笔至今挥此挽，荒碑何处锁寒烟。\n莫嗟荣养迟三釜，已见銮章下九天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51915,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过韶州 其一","author":"林光","text":"芙蓉驿下雨霏霏，山色留人缆解迟。\n城郭为谁穿瘦马，东林老树有精知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51916,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过韶州 其二","author":"林光","text":"青青簇簇水逶迤，丞相祠前欲雨时。\n自笑自歌谁曾得，送人韶石俯江湄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51917,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过抛","author":"林光","text":"欹斜千百岭，宛转十三抛。\n云气穿山罅，滩流倒石坳。\n澄潭没乌鬼，怪壁断羲爻。\n最爱悬崖下，疏松着几梢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51918,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿狸溪口","author":"林光","text":"薄暮投何处，移蒿就浅滩。\n孤篷飘雨急，细浪拍舟寒。\n诗浸千山气，风传万竹竿。\n旅怀殊不恶，高枕入更阑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51919,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过新妇潭二首 其一","author":"林光","text":"新妇立潭边，亭亭不记年。\n知他潭外水，送尽几人船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51920,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过新妇潭二首 其二","author":"林光","text":"新妇背潭立，潭深不肯看。\n还嫌潭内水，风起亦生澜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51921,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上金匙银箸滩","author":"林光","text":"谩向滩头插纸钱，金匙银箸险相连。\n人间自有安流处，笑煞南来北去船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51922,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经南安吟风弄月台","author":"林光","text":"几点奎星久聚天，斯文谁假此因缘。\n人间有子还须父，天下无师孰与传。\n风月会归心醉后，云山高在笔头边。\n崇卑品秩今休问，日在晴空水在渊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51923,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过大庾岭","author":"林光","text":"南连沧海北长江，庾岭分明迫上苍。\n唐相为谁开此道，涧松犹自领年光。\n货通南土诛求尽，泉界红梅去任忙。\n丁巳肩舆又南至，羞将短鬓犯寒霜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51924,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安偶题七首 其一","author":"林光","text":"长笑梅关不见梅，肩舆扶我几低徊。\n却疑冰玉閒恣态，厌见风尘日往来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51925,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安偶题七首 其二","author":"林光","text":"潦倒何心过岭来，暖风晴日一阳回。\n水边篱落频经目，细看天机认老梅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51926,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安偶题七首 其三","author":"林光","text":"长风暂扫瘴烟消，屈指阳和又一朝。\n红树白云山四面，可人诗景自相撩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51927,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南安偶题七首 其四","author":"林光","text":"面面青山送积阴，南安城子落锅心。\n旧游每忆程兄弟，真乐人閒何处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":51928,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]